WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.701
-Welcome back to the show,
everybody.

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:05.200
You know, not a lot of things
are certain in this crazy world.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.167
We scurry through life
lickety-split

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.200
from one fleeting experience to
another.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.801
Nothing seems sacred anymore.

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:13.067
Nothing seems permanent.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:15.100
And that's why this week at "The
Tonight Show" we're saluting

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.567
the one thing we know is still
permanent, the permanent,

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:21.801
a.k.a. the permanent wave,
a.k.a. the perm.

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:25.567
That's right. It's the return of
"Tonight Show Perm Week!"

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:30.200
-♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.234
♪ On the Fallon show ♪

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:36.534
♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:40.501
♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:46.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.267
-This is "Tonight Show
Perm Week."

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:52.601
It's a very special week where
every day we pick someone

00:00:52.601 --> 00:00:55.667
from our audience and stylishly
perm their hair.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:59.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:02.734
Since it is a Valentine's Day,

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:07.000
tonight we are perming not one,
but two people, a couple.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.400
Yes. The lucky perm recipients

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:13.033
are Tamara Doherty
and Kami Cotter.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:16.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:18.000
Tamara is from Staten Island.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.601
Kami is from Colorado.

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:21.501
And they're very excited about
their new hairdos.

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:24.234
It's been a big day for them.
Take a look.

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:27.133
-Hi. I'm Tamara Doherty.
-Hi. I'm Kami Cotter.

00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:29.267
-And today we're getting perms.

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:32.434
Hearing about perms, I did have
to go on to Google and to check

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.934
if it was straightening your
hair or curling your hair.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.133
-I'm hoping it's not
like too poofy.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:40.334
This really wasn't my idea.
I kind of just tagged along.

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:43.334
-I am kind of going after Dolly,
the queen of the perms.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.300
I would love a little bit of
Drew Barrymore perm

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.534
in there as well.
-I'd rather be at a spa day

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.300
today than getting a perm,
but it will still be

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.968
a Valentine's Day to remember.

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:54.734
-You can't plan a perm.
It's just gotta kind of happen.

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:58.133
So I'm ready to see
who I look like.

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:02.334
-I can't wait to see what Tamara
and Kami are going to look like.

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.901
Now, they've been sequestered
since they got permed.

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:06.801
So they haven't really seen
themselves yet.

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:08.801
And they also haven't seen
each other.

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:11.567
This entire process has been
cloaked in secrecy.

00:02:11.567 --> 00:02:12.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:14.901
Audience, are you ready to see
the brand-new,

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.100
freshly permed Tamara and Kami?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.000
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.434
Here they are before.

00:02:22.434 --> 00:02:23.934
And here they are now.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:27.100
Tamara and Kami, come on out!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.667
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:34.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.667
-Oh, my God.

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:39.334
-Wow. What do you think?

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:42.234
-It is amazing.
-What do you think?

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:44.834
-I said I'd love if she could
look like Julia Louis-Dreyfus.

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:47.133
And I think we nailed it.
-Yes.

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:49.467
You did -- Wow. I love it.

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:51.467
Do you like the look?
-I don't know yet, Jimmy.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.567
-Oh, that's right,
you don't know yet.

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:56.634
Have you ever done anything like
this to your hair?

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:58.467
-No.
-No.

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:00.167
-What do you think?
Audience, this is pretty good.

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:04.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:05.667
Are you ready?

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:07.334
Happy Valentine's Day,
by the way.

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:09.801
Now for the most important
reveal of all,

00:03:09.801 --> 00:03:12.534
Tamara, Kami, are you ready
to see yourselves?

00:03:12.534 --> 00:03:16.000
-Yeah.
-Alright. Three, two, one.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.601
Let's reveal.

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.434
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, Lord.

00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:21.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:25.100
-I love it.
I think you look great.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.868
I think you look fantastic!
You guys look good.

00:03:27.868 --> 00:03:30.767
-The curly girls.
-Look at the curly girls.

00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:33.300
Come on. Do you guys -- Do you
like the new look?

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.000
-Yeah, I love the new look.
-You're keeping it?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.200
-We're keeping it.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.334
-At least keep it for
the next couple days.

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:38.434
-Yeah, until next
Valentine's Day.

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:39.934
-Until next Valentine's Day.
I love it.

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:44.267
Our thanks to the Mark and Ryan
Salon for these wonderful perms.

00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:46.067
Happy Perm Week, everyone!

00:03:46.067 --> 00:03:47.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:48.801
Yes!

00:03:48.801 --> 00:03:51.100
Stick around, we'll be right
back with more "Tonight Show."

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.868
I love it! You look fantastic.

00:03:52.868 --> 00:03:56.133
-♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:59.100
♪ On the Fallon show ♪

